,"_239":305,"_241":242,"_243":244,"_245":306,"_247":248},{"_235":298,"_237":238,"_239":299,"_241":242,"_243":244,"_245":300,"_247":248},{"_235":292,"_237":238,"_239":293,"_241":242,"_243":244,"_245":294,"_247":248},{"_235":286,"_237":238,"_239":287,"_241":242,"_243":244,"_245":288,"_247":248},{"_235":280,"_237":238,"_239":281,"_241":242,"_243":244,"_245":282,"_247":248},{"_235":274,"_237":238,"_239":275,"_241":242,"_243":244,"_245":276,"_247":248},{"_235":268,"_237":238,"_239":269,"_241":242,"_243":244,"_245":270,"_247":248},{"_235":262,"_237":238,"_239":263,"_241":242,"_243":244,"_245":264,"_247":248},{"_235":256,"_237":238,"_239":257,"_241":242,"_243":244,"_245":258,"_247":248},{"_235":236,"_237":238,"_239":240,"_241":242,"_243":244,"_245":246,"_247":248},"_key","249fa7fca2c7","_type","block","children",[249],"level",1,"listItem","bullet","markDefs",[],"style","normal",{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":253,"_254":255},"cd808d0de756","span","marks",[],"text","Luxury landscaping and architectural façade","e9fe700dc304",[259],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":260,"_254":261},[],"Energy-efficient construction","1d830c37c487",[265],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":266,"_254":267},[],"Multiple indoor and outdoor entertaining areas","3a9fa4e6b67a",[271],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":272,"_254":273},[],"Engineered timber flooring","9e79372099b2",[277],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":278,"_254":279},[],"Custom-designed joinery throughout","3a9fa2e060d4",[283],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":284,"_254":285},[],"Designer kitchen with premium appliances and butler’s pantry","fdaddf99d9a1",[289],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":290,"_254":291},[],"Feature fireplace with full-height marble surround","9e629aeafb66",[295],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":296,"_254":297},[],"Premium marble and natural stone throughout","e5cf8968932b",[301],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":302,"_254":303},[],"Floor-to-ceiling architectural glazing","c97a58816d63",[307],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":308,"_254":309},[],"3-metre ceilings throughout","d57d39bde4f5",[313],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":314,"_254":315},[],"Grand double-height entrance with feature void","12834a1e2883",[319],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":320,"_254":321},[],"Dedicated home theatre","ef6b92bd34cc",[325],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":326,"_254":327},[],"Architectural spiral staircase","23a12f193411",[331],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":332,"_254":333},[],"Resort-style swimming pool and integrated spa","de574eb36a64",[337],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":338,"_254":339},[],"Prestigious golf course frontage","6bc0db9aab57",[343],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":344,"_254":345},[],"Approximately 560sqm (60 Squares) custom residence","e311ce228169",[350],[],"h3",{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":351,"_254":352},[],"Key Features","2839ad7792ad",[356],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":357,"_254":358},[],"By managing every stage of the project—from design coordination and approvals through to construction and final handover—we delivered a residence that exceeds expectations in both quality and design.","6ca1b477e11e",[362],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":363,"_254":364},[],"The home features a dramatic double-height entrance, a custom spiral staircase, premium natural stone finishes, bespoke joinery and expansive floor-to-ceiling glazing that frames the surrounding golf course. A resort-style swimming pool and spa create a seamless connection between the indoor living spaces and the outdoor entertaining area, while every material and finish was carefully selected to deliver a timeless, luxurious home.","21f58fd85f3c",[368],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":369,"_254":370},[],"Working closely with the client from concept through to completion, Siari Build delivered a bespoke residence that combines sophisticated architectural design with superior craftsmanship.","c1bf7876449a",[374],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":375,"_254":376},[],"Our Solution","0e9fe8d1d23f",[380],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":381,"_254":382},[],"Executing these design ambitions demanded meticulous planning, precision construction and exceptional attention to detail across every stage of the project.","8e1a3fec833b",[386],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":387,"_254":388},[],"The vision was to create a statement residence that maximised its premium golf course location while delivering uncompromising luxury and everyday practicality. The design required expansive open-plan living, abundant natural light, seamless indoor-outdoor integration and premium architectural detailing throughout, while maintaining privacy, energy efficiency and timeless appeal.","377ee23dc1ca",[392],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":393,"_254":394},[],"The Challenge","a581b14364f3",[398],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":399,"_254":400},[],"Positioned within the prestigious Sanctuary Lakes estate overlooking the golf course, the home seamlessly integrates indoor and outdoor living through floor-to-ceiling glazing, a resort-style swimming pool and spa, and generous entertaining spaces. Every aspect of the residence has been meticulously designed to create a home that is both luxurious and functional.","af2624f57fe4",[404],[],{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":405,"_254":406},[],"The Tiffany Walk Residence is a luxury custom home designed to deliver timeless architecture, exceptional craftsmanship and resort-style family living. Spanning approximately 560sqm (60 Squares), this residence showcases premium finishes, expansive living spaces and carefully considered architectural details throughout.","6d3fc6ef7496",[411],[],"h2",{"_235":250,"_237":251,"_252":412,"_254":413},[],"Overview",{"_415":416,"_417":418,"_419":420},"settings",{"_478":479,"_480":481,"_482":483,"_484":485,"_486":114,"_487":488,"_489":-5,"_490":491,"_492":442,"_493":-5,"_494":-5,"_495":442,"_496":497,"_498":499,"_500":501,"_502":503,"_504":-5,"_505":506,"_507":508,"_141":509,"_510":511,"_512":513},"navigation",{"_439":440,"_441":442,"_443":444,"_445":446},"services",[421,422,423,424,425,426],{"_254":437,"_30":438},{"_254":435,"_30":436},{"_254":433,"_30":434},{"_254":431,"_30":432},{"_254":429,"_30":430},{"_254":427,"_30":428},"Extra space for family, guests or rental income - designed and built properly, not bolted on.","Granny Flats","From a single kitchen to a whole-home transformation - old bones, new life.","Renovations","More room without the move. Ground-floor and second-storey extensions that look like they were always there.","Extensions & Additions","Dual occupancies and townhouses that get the most out of your site — and your return.","Multi-Dwelling Developments","Already have plans or an architect? We build to your design with the rigour it deserves.","Bespoke Builds","Architecturally led homes built around how you actually live — not a catalogue floor plan.","Custom Homes","footerMenu",[467,468,469,470,471,472],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[452,453,454,455],"socialMenu",[447],{"_448":-5,"_449":450,"_167":451},"icon","label","Instagram","https://www.instagram.com/siari_build/",{"_449":-5,"_457":465,"_459":466},{"_449":-5,"_457":463,"_459":464},{"_449":-5,"_457":461,"_459":462},{"_449":456,"_457":458,"_459":460},"Start Your Project","pageSlug","contact","pageTitle","Contact","projects","Projects","about","About","home","Home",{"_449":-5,"_457":465,"_459":466},{"_449":-5,"_457":463,"_459":464},{"_449":-5,"_457":461,"_459":462},{"_449":-5,"_457":458,"_459":460},{"_449":475,"_457":476,"_459":477},{"_449":-5,"_457":473,"_459":474},"privacy-policy","Privacy Policy","FAQ","faq","Frequently Asked Questions","address","Point Cook, Victoria","copyrightText","All rights reserved.","email","info@siaribuild.com.au","legalLine","ABN 20 688 039 894 | Builder License CDB-U 101713","maintenanceEnabled","maintenanceHeading","WE'RE ON THE TOOLS.","maintenanceImage","maintenanceMessage","The site's getting a quick upgrade and will be back shortly. In the meantime, if you'd like to start a project, reach us using the options below.","maintenanceShowContact","mapAddressLabel","mapAreaRadius","mapHidePin","mapLocation",{"_237":514,"_161":515,"_516":517,"_518":519},"mapZoom",12,"notFoundButtonLabel","Back to Home","notFoundHeading","THIS ONE'S OFF THE PLANS.","notFoundImage","notFoundMessage","The page you're after isn't here — moved, renamed, or never built. Let's get you back to solid ground.","phone","0419 000 991","Siari Build","tagline","Designed to Impress. Built to Last.","workingHours","Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\nSaturday: 9:00 AM - 2:00 PM\nSunday: Closed","geopoint",7,"lat",-37.895696,"lng",144.76186]
